# mlx_safe.supp
# Generated from your Valgrind output for cub3D + MiniLibX on Linux/X11.
# Purpose: hide external MiniLibX/X11/Xcursor/dlopen noise only.
#
# Important:
# - This file suppresses Memcheck:Param from X11 writev noise.
# - This file suppresses only reachable leaks.
# - It intentionally does NOT suppress definite or indirect leaks.
#
# In your current log, the real texture leak through mlx_xpm_file_to_image
# remains visible and should be fixed with mlx_destroy_image on every texture.


